//	**          OUTER LEFT JOIN         ->   same as LEFT JOIN
//	**          LEFT NATURAL JOIN       ->   same as NATURAL LEFT JOIN
//	**          LEFT RIGHT JOIN         ->   same as FULL JOIN
//	**          RIGHT OUTER FULL JOIN   ->   same as FULL JOIN
