//	/*
//	** Alternative compound select code generator for cases when there
//	** is an ORDER BY clause.
//	**
//	** We assume a query of the following form:
//	**
//	**      <selectA>  <operator>  <selectB>  ORDER BY <orderbylist>
//	**
